shot    dmake
cap     dmake, a parallel make with a makefile dialect of its own, on the
cap     greeting rule of DOC/make/demo.mk, which copies SYS/motd: it reads
cap     the shipped makefile and builds the target.
try     dmake -f DOC/make/demo.mk greeting
run     builtin cd /dd
wait    1
